# Terminal & Build Hygiene (BSOD Analyzer)

Follow **`generic-terminal-and-build-hygiene.mdc`**. Skill: **`agent-terminal-hygiene`**.

**This project:**
- Agent/CI build: `build_ci.bat` (sets `BUILD_NOPAUSE=1`)
- Manual build: `build_and_deploy_v6.bat` (runs full `run_tests.bat` first)
- Version: edit `bsod_analyzer.VERSION` only; `run_tests.bat` and builds run `scripts\apply_version.py sync` (see `version-sync.mdc`)
- Fix stale agent logs / orphans: MCP `agent_hygiene_full_check` or `%USERPROFILE%\.cursor\AgentStarterPack\pack\scripts\`
- Starter pack project (separate): `Desktop\AgentStarterPack` — not this repo
